{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-11-06T03:20:50.260385Z", "id": "github:release:963138341:release:434253514", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 119, "prerelease": false, "stars": 1504, "stars_delta": 0, "tag_name": "2026.11.04"}, "organization": "knmcguire", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-11-05T08:58:57Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "963138341:release:434253514", "summary": "## \ud83d\udcc8 Trending Up\r\n\r\n_Projects that have a higher project-quality score compared to the last update. There might be a variety of reasons, such as increased downloads or code activity._\r\n\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://byu-holoocean.github.io/holoocean-docs/\">HoloOcean</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4714 \u00b7  \u2b50 160 \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc8) - A UE5 based simulator for marine perception and autonomy, with multi-agent communications and many common underwater.. <code><a href=\"https://tldrlegal.com/search?q=MIT%20and%20Unreal%20Engine%20EULA\">MIT and Unreal Engine EULA</a></code>\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udcc9 Trending Down\r\n\r\n_Projects that have a lower project-quality score compared to the last update. There might be a variety of reasons such as decreased downloads or code activity._\r\n\r\n- <b><a href=\"http://stack-of-tasks.github.io/pinocchio/\">Pinocchio</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4724 \u00b7  \u2b50 3.6K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) - A fast and flexible implementation of Rigid Body Dynamics algorithms and their analytical derivatives. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/3rqEWVr\">BSD-2</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://github.com/mujocolab/mjlab\">mjlab</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4722 \u00b7  \u2b50 2.8K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) - Isaac Lab API, powered by MuJoCo-Warp, for RL and robotics research. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/3nYMfla\">Apache-2</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://highway-env.farama.org/\">HighwayEnv</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4720 \u00b7  \u2b50 3.3K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) - A collection of environments for autonomous driving and tactical decision-making tasks. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/34MBwT8\">MIT</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://playground.mujoco.org/\">MuJoCo playground</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4911 \u00b7  \u2b50 2.1K \u00b7 \ud83d\udc23) - An open-source library for GPU-accelerated robot learning and sim-to-real transfer. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/3nYMfla\">Apache-2</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://github.com/rlxai/rbot\">Rbot</a></b> (\ud83e\udd491 \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) -  <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/3nYMfla\">Apache-2</a></code>\r\n\r\n## \u2795 Added Projects\r\n\r\n_Projects that were recently added to this best-of list._\r\n\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://pterolabs.ai/\">PteroSim</a></b> (\ud83e\udd492 \u00b7 \u2795) - UAV simulator on Unreal Engine 5 with JSBSim flight dynamics, PX4 and ArduPilot SITL, and a gRPC API with a Python SDK.. <code><a href=\"https://tldrlegal.com/search?q=proprietary\">proprietary</a></code>\r\n\r\n", "title": "knmcguire/best-of-robot-simulators Update: 2026.11.04", "topics": ["object_detection", "robotics_mapping", "robotics_perception", "vr_mr_xr"], "updated_at": "2026-11-05T08:58:57Z", "url": "https://github.com/knmcguire/best-of-robot-simulators/releases/tag/2026.11.04", "venue": null}
